      "title": "Stickoo",
      "tagline": "Words you can collect.",
      "text": "A language app for children, developed from scratch. Each child picks a hero, hears a word — 엄마, maman, mother — and answers a little quiz by touching the right picture. Every right answer unlocks a sticker for their album; fill a page and new words arrive. Korean, French, English and Spanish, one word at a time, with characters that grow up alongside the player — from pyjamas to superpowers.",
